        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "14ed4378-56a0-3084-b050-8e334b3975b1",
                "word": "cauchemardesque",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0015cf34-e34d-4368-8617-c371a029e3ac",
                        "entry_id": "14ed4378-56a0-3084-b050-8e334b3975b1",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "cauchemardesques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8fd0b8a8-2acd-33ea-aa37-0f50de7755c4",
                        "entry_id": "14ed4378-56a0-3084-b050-8e334b3975b1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Horrible, pénible, lourd, oppressant comme un cauchemar."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9c69c2e-b851-4639-ba05-fd3142711afa",
                                "sense_id": "8fd0b8a8-2acd-33ea-aa37-0f50de7755c4",
                                "text": "Éviter aussi que les tensions dans le Golfe provoquent une flambée des prix du pétrole, scénario cauchemardesque pour une Europe financièrement mal en point, ainsi que pour le président américain, Barack Obama, qui veut se faire réélire en novembre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2d5053f-f5c0-451f-95d2-a4d6b9583813",
                                "sense_id": "8fd0b8a8-2acd-33ea-aa37-0f50de7755c4",
                                "text": "Visiblement, Babbo marinait depuis des années dans ce scénario cauchemardesque. — (Daniel Nayeri, Coco et Cloclo, dans Brigade des crimes imaginaires et autres histoires fantastiques et déglinguées, traduit de l’anglais par Valérie Le Plouhinec, Hélium, 2008, page 327)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3cd38c4b-ac2e-433a-980c-3e97cb5f2ae2",
                                "sense_id": "8fd0b8a8-2acd-33ea-aa37-0f50de7755c4",
                                "text": "Visage fermé, épaules légèrement rentrées, Donald Trump semble bien seul samedi sur son parcours de golf, près de Washington. À l’image d’un week-end cauchemardesque marqué par la victoire de Joe Biden et par la joie de l’Amérique démocrate jusque sous les fenêtres de la Maison-Blanche."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "86f3573c-8628-48be-a01d-3abbc0b5c3b8",
                        "source_entry_id": "14ed4378-56a0-3084-b050-8e334b3975b1",
                        "source_sense_id": "8fd0b8a8-2acd-33ea-aa37-0f50de7755c4",
                        "target_lang_word": "nightmarish",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nightmarish",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6504acb-c2e3-3f0e-a528-f4c403646437",
                                        "entry_id": "1ab9190b-da2e-3bed-b072-4936130f25e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling a nightmare."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "247bdff2-dabb-4a75-8ffd-1c541670d97c",
                                                "sense_id": "d6504acb-c2e3-3f0e-a528-f4c403646437",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile, the everyday landscape becomes more nightmarish and unmanageable each year."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc520141-bc6f-42a1-93b5-8750bd74c8d4",
                                                "sense_id": "d6504acb-c2e3-3f0e-a528-f4c403646437",
                                                "text": "The dragon from under-earth,\nthe nightmarish destroyer, lay destroyed as well,\nutterly without life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f89ddea-a9cb-4d6f-b22f-2d00860b40ba",
                                                "sense_id": "d6504acb-c2e3-3f0e-a528-f4c403646437",
                                                "text": "Nineteen Eighty-Four was written in 1949. Its nightmarish fictional world is now 37 years in the past, so one might reasonably conclude that Orwell was far too pessimistic, but his great book was less a prediction than a warning, and above all an analysis of the totalitarian mentality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d463bad-90b9-41b7-ac5c-27efb4c1285e",
                                                "sense_id": "d6504acb-c2e3-3f0e-a528-f4c403646437",
                                                "text": "People sometimes find the idea of buying and selling human bones nightmarish, but Ferry told The Washington Post he doesn’t think of it that way. He says he admires and respects the structure of bones."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f315e64f-38e2-4d5d-8811-6fa978711416",
                        "source_entry_id": "14ed4378-56a0-3084-b050-8e334b3975b1",
